		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010010a"},
		line=890,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Early spring, Tenkyo─",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The chilly breeze blowing through the Imperial Tomb dries my lips.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"The gravestones of Emperors past, naturally, have no words for me.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"They merely stand motionless against the cold wind, reproachful of my long-overdue arrival.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"I kneel at the gravestone of my mother, Empre",
{"ruby", text="Sappanwood"},
"ss Suou, f",
{"/ruby"},
"or the first time.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“(I beg your forgiveness, Mother. I've kept you waiting for far too long.)”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“(Forthwith, you may bear witness as I avenge your death.)”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"The whispers of my heart conjure up memories of distant days.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"My mother, Empress Suou, was a strict woman.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Whenever she spoke of her resolve as Empress, she gazed at my young self with exceptional strength in her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Suou"},
			{
"“Our Imperial Family has been entrusted with the Empire by Oomikami Himself.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Suou"},
			{
"“As such, we have a duty to protect the land's harvests and the country's peace in His stead.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Suou"},
			{
"“Understand so far, dear?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Yes, Mother.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Suou"},
			{
"“Then, should an Empress fail to fulfill her duty, how must she conduct herself?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“She should beg Oomikami's forgiveness at the cost of her own life.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I've answered this question in the same way for as long as I can remember.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Suou"},
			{
"“Countless generations of Emperors have abided by these teachings.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Suou"},
			{
"“You must always steel your resolve. When the time comes to offer your life, there must be no hesitation.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Mother's hand strokes my hair.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"The warmth of her hand is filled with much more than just her strictness.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Hehee, Mother.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Having lost my father at a young age, Mother was my only family, as well as the object of my aspirations.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Empress Suou was revered by her people even more highly than her predecessors.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Her smile brought them tranquility, and her words inspired courage within them.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Her domestic affairs ran smoothly, and the citizens of the Empire enjoyed an age of peace and prosperity.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Furthermore, the nation's defenses were robust.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"A powerful Artifact created by priestesses of old, the Barrier, generated a wall encircling the Empire's lands and turned away all manner of invaders.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Even if an enemy were to break through, the Empire's dauntless warriors would surely scatter them.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"On the off chance that even they should suffer defeat, the Three Sacred Treasures bestowed upon us by Oomikami would certainly protect the Empire with their divine power.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Neither I nor a single citizen ever doubted the strength of this tripartite defense.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"But on that day three years ago...",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Such a naïve view crumbled out from under us in the blink of an eye.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Lady-in-waiting"},
			{
"“Run, Your Highness!”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“What?! What's going on?!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Lady-in-waiting"},
			{
"“The Republic... is invading...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"An explosion sets my ears ringing, and I lose my sense of equilibrium.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"The court lady I was just talking to is no longer moving.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"My mind fails to keep up with the suddenness of it all.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Th-That's right. I need to find Mother.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"I weave through the retainers running in panicked circles and make for the audience chamber.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Now that war has broken out, the Imperial Family needs to take command.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Have the warriors moved to engage the enemy?",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Have the priesthood's magicker units been assembled?",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Mother, what's the situation?!”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"My brain fails at first to process the scene before me.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Even as I struggle to comprehend it, my teeth chatter, and my body is overcome with terror.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"Mother is sitting on her throne, just as always.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"But her head hangs lifelessly, and her divine white raiments are stained a vivid scarlet.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Well, well, Your Highness. I've been expecting your arrival.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Okonogi is standing to the side of the throne.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"In his hand, there is a bloodstained dagger.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Though I can't see it, I imagine fresh blood dripping from the tip.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“H-How... dare you...!”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“It is precisely as Her Majesty has said time and again. An Empress who fails to protect the Empire must atone with her life.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“And truly, truly she has! True to her word, Her Majesty has finally fulfilled her sacred duty.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Such marvelous resolve! How befitting of the wise and benevolent Empress Suou!”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Is that what I ought to say? Hahahaha! Hahahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"His irritating laughter echoes throughout the hall.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“My, my, my. She really ought have heeded my warnings. Her Majesty truly reaped what she sowed.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Henceforth, I, Okonogi Tokihiko, shall rule the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“How dare a mere minister kill the Empress?!”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Aah!”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"A crashing impact blows me away.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Rubble from the collapsing ceiling piles up between me and Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"I can no longer reach him.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“Now, then, I believe I shall be taking my leave.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“I am a busy man, you know. I have much to discuss with the gentlemen of the Republic concerning our future.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Okonogi"},
			{
"“You would do well to leave this place, too, Your Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Okonogiiii!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"I scream in vain as Okonogi disappears beyond the rubble.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"I need to attend to Mother─",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness, this place is too dangerous. Your Highness\nmustn't tarry any longer!”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Even as I try to climb over the rubble, a hand firmly grasps me from behind.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Let me go!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Call the priestesses! Have them use their healing magicks on Mother!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness's life is in danger!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Satonaka and the guards seize my arms and drag me into an underground passage.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"I scream, and scream, and scream myself hoarse, but the audience chamber steadily recedes into the distance.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"The more I struggle, the more I'm faced with my own powerlessness.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"I remember little of what happened afterwards.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"All I can recall is being halfway-dragged through a damp and dark tunnel.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Before I know it, I'm standing at the Imperial Tomb.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Accompanying me is Satonaka, head of my ladies-in-waiting.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"The shocking sight of the city instantly rouses my wavering consciousness.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Tenkyo is burning...”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“The Republicans have breached the Barrier.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"The Barrier is the foundation of our national defense, a device that generates a wall of magicks surrounding our dominion.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Nearly a hundred members of the priesthood, headed by the Exalt-Priestess, should have been protecting it, but it lies broken, cleaved into two.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Okonogi must have destroyed it.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"The Republican Army has made landfall at the coastline and is now marching on the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"The warriors will annihilate every last enemy that breaches the Barrier─",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"Or so I believed, but I cannot hear the telltale sounds of clashing blades from anywhere.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“What's happened to the warriors?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Judging by the state of affairs, I fear that few are still fighting.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"I look and see that the Warrior District has been utterly and thoroughly obliterated.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"It must have been bombed immediately after hostilities commenced.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Otherwise, the warriors never would have been defeated.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The Barrier lies in shambles, and the warriors have been routed.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"My mother, the bearer of the Three Sacred Treasures, has been slain by Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"We have nothing left with which to fight.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“The enemy is closing in.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“Your Highness must escape to Iseya. I shall accompany Your Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“But... Mother... And Tenkyo...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Ghh!”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"An object suddenly explodes at my feet.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"The sky and the earth tumble around before my eyes, and shards of stone shrapnel stab into my body.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“*Cough... hack...*”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"I force air into my lungs and somehow manage to stand up.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"A group of Republican soldiers approaches from the distance.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"They number fifty... no, a hundred men.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"They're here to capture us.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Satonaka"},
			{
"“H-Highness... Please... Run...”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Satonaka! Satonaka!”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Satonaka collapses to the ground and lies still.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"I stand alone before the Republican Army.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"There's no escape for me now.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"I-I have to fight.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"I mustn't bring shame upon the Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"I put strength into my trembling legs and somehow rise to my feet.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“Kindly allow me to handle this.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Suddenly, I hear a man's voice.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"It's a calm voice, one ill-suited for the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"So ill-suited, in fact, that I wonder if the sight before me is but a dream.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"A single warrior is kneeling in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"I don't recognize his face.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“Your court lady is merely unconscious.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“Please wait but a trifle, Your Highness. I shall attend to your protection.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“There's nearly a hundred of them. Surely even a warrior...”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“Whether they number one or a hundred, my duty is unyielding.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“I shall do my utmost that I may protect you, Your Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"The man speaks clearly without any hint of pretense.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"How can I describe the surge of emotions running through me?",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"My heart swells with the sudden hope that I might be saved, yet another part of me laments being unable to fight alongside him.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"With him by my side, we could vanquish not just the soldiers before us, but every last calamity in the world─",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"I feel a dreamlike courage begin bubbling up inside me.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“I shall never forget such fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“I-I would have your name.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“──────”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"An explosion erases his name before it can reach my ears.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"The man takes out a hand towel and uses it to wipe my cheek.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"The white towel is soon stained with my blood and sweat.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“If Your Highness's face is stained with blood, the resolution of the warriors will be called into question.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"He gently places the towel in my hand with the slightest hint of a smile playing across his lips.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"That must be his idea of a joke.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Looking back on it now, that line wasn't the least bit funny, but at that time, I surely burst into peals of laughter.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“I leave everything in your hands.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Please, save me...”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“No.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Protect me!”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“Your will be done!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"The moment after he bows his head─",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"─the warrior is soaring through the air.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"He lands squarely in the middle of the Republican formation.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"With a splendid, waltz-like spin...",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Five enemy soldiers are instantly rent into mere chunks of flesh.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"The remaining soldiers blindly let loose a bestial roar of fire.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"But the warrior is no longer where they aimed.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Having missed their target, the bullets instead find their mark in friendly Republican soldiers.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"This breeds further confusion, and the battlefield descends into pandemonium.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Their firepower is practically meaningless.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Not a single Republican soldier can even lay their gaze on the warrior.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"It happens in the blink of an eye.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Like wheat stalks before a mighty tempest, the Republican soldiers are effortlessly threshed into lifeless heaps of flesh.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"─He's a demon.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"I'm being saved, and yet I tremble.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"I tremble with the instinctual fear known to all living creatures.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"But─",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"This sight feels somehow familiar.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"...Did I see it in a dream, or perhaps read it in some book?",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"An ardent love surges up from deep within my heart of hearts.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"I want nothing more in this moment than to run up to him, to bury my face in his broad chest.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"But my body knows that I mustn't get near.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"The battlefield is his stage alone.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"A domain where outsiders dare not tread.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"The air is perfused with the stench of gunpowder and iron.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"The earth is stained with rivers of blood.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"The silence is unsettling, devoid even of moans.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"He alone remains standing.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"The rice paper he uses to wipe his spellblade clean dances on the wind like a flower petal.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“(He's beautiful.)”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Such overwhelming strength...",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"There lies within him a beauty that defies comprehension, like that of a divine beast.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“The deed is done.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Huh? Uh, yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"I've done absolutely nothing but watch, yet my body is ablaze with heat.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"I'm helpless to stop my face from growing redder and redder.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"What is this I'm feeling? What's wrong with me?",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“Are you injured?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“I-I-I'm fine! It's nothing. Absolutely nothing!”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"I look up at his face in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"What in the world am I doing at a time like this?",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"I don't know what's going on anymore.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“A-A-Anyways, splendidly done! Let us get away at once.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“I shall gladly accom─”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"The man stops mid-sentence.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“What's wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“It seems accompanying Your Highness may prove to be difficult.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"The man turns around with a sigh.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"There is nothing on the ground but a large pool of blood and the silent corpses of soldiers.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"All that moves is...",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Ugh!”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"A sharp pain stabs through my head.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"I'm wracked with such revulsion and nausea that it feels like I'm being turned inside-out.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Wh-What the... My head... hurts...”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“I see. It really ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"is",
{"/font"},
" you.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Perhaps my eyes are playing tricks on me, but the warrior smiles as though he were a completely different person.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“Take your court lady and flee. I'll handle this.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“B-But─”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“Now!”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“But what about─”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Warrior"},
			{
"“Now!!”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"His shout spurs me to my feet.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"That is the last I remember of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"The biting wind rouses me from my reverie.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“(It's been three years since then...)”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"One week after hostilities began, Okonogi signed an armistice with the Republic as the Empire's plenipotentiary.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"Thus ended the Empire's two-thousand-year long reign. Its eighty million citizens now live under Republican rule.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"Hostilities with the Republic were effectively over in a matter of hours─an all too swift and bitter defeat.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Thereafter, Okonogi ruled the Empire as the Republic's loyal lapdog.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"First, he announced that Empress Suou had ended her life in atonement for the Empire's defeat.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"He asserted the legitimacy of his authority by claiming she had entrusted him with the Empire in her will.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"Then, he placed some nameless girl on the Imperial Throne and seized authority as her regent.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			{
"This is all a fabrication, of course.",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"To cover up his misdeeds, he purged all of the Imperial\nFamily's most loyal retainers out of fear that the truth would come to light.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"There is nobody left in the Imperial government who might defy Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Okonogi Tokihiko...",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"The man who destroyed the Barrier and invited the Republican Army upon our doorstep.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"The man who killed my mother and sold out his own country for personal gain.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"If not for that man, we surely would not have yielded so easily to the Republic.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"As the last surviving member of the Imperial Family, I cannot suffer him to live.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“Mother.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Girl"},
			{
"“I implore you, bear witness to your unworthy daughter's final moments.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
